    "title": "字符串操作",
    "slug": "python-08-strings",
    "description": "学习字符串的拼接、切片和格式化",
    "content": "# 字符串操作\n\n## 字符串拼接\n```python\ngreeting = \"Hello\" + \" \" + \"World\"\nname = \"Python\"\nmessage = f\"Welcome to {name}!\"\n```\n\n## 字符串切片\n```python\ns = \"Hello, World!\"\ns[0:5]    # \"Hello\"\ns[:5]     # \"Hello\"\ns[7:]     # \"World!\"\ns[-6:]    # \"orld!\"\ns[::-1]   # \"!dlroW ,olleH\" 反转\n```\n\n## 常用方法\n```python\n\"hello\".upper()       # \"HELLO\"\n\"HELLO\".lower()       # \"hello\"\n\"  hi  \".strip()      # \"hi\"\n\"hello world\".split() # [\"hello\", \"world\"]\n\"-\".join([\"a\",\"b\"])   # \"a-b\"\n\"hello\".replace(\"l\", \"r\")  # \"herro\"\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写函数 `reverse_string(s)`，返回反转后的字符串。\n编写函数 `is_palindrome(s)`，判断字符串是否为回文（忽略大小写和空格）。\n",
    "order": 8,
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "xp_reward": 10,
    "starter_code": "def reverse_string(s):\n    # 返回反转后的字符串\n    pass\n\ndef is_palindrome(s):\n    # 判断是否为回文（忽略大小写和空格）\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "def reverse_string(s):\n    return s[::-1]\n\ndef is_palindrome(s):\n    cleaned = s.lower().replace(\" \", \"\")\n    return cleaned == cleaned[::-1]",
    "test_cases": [
