        "input": "square_evens([])",
        "expected_output": "[]",
        "description": "square_evens([]) 应返回空列表（边界）"
      },
      {
        "input": "flatten([[1,2],[3,4]])",
        "expected_output": "[1, 2, 3, 4]",
        "description": "flatten 应展平二维列表"
      },
      {
        "input": "flatten([])",
        "expected_output": "[]",
        "description": "flatten([]) 应返回空列表（边界）"
      }
    ],
    "hint": "使用 [x**2 for x in nums if x % 2 == 0] 筛选偶数并平方"
  },
  {
    "title": "异常处理",
    "slug": "python-12-exceptions",
    "description": "学习 try/except 异常处理机制",
    "content": "# 异常处理\n\n## 为什么需要异常处理？\n程序运行时可能遇到各种错误：文件不存在、网络断开、用户输入无效等。异常处理让程序优雅地应对这些情况。\n\n## try/except 结构\n```python\ntry:\n    num = int(input('请输入数字: '))\n    result = 100 / num\n    print(f'结果: {result}')\nexcept ValueError:\n    print('输入不是有效数字！')\nexcept ZeroDivisionError:\n    print('不能除以零！')\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f'未知错误: {e}')\nelse:\n    print('没有异常时执行这里')\nfinally:\n    print('无论如何都会执行')\n```\n\n## 常见异常类型\n| 异常 | 触发条件 |\n|------|---------|\n| `ValueError` | 值错误（如int('abc')） |\n| `TypeError` | 类型错误 |\n| `ZeroDivisionError` | 除以零 |\n| `KeyError` | 字典键不存在 |\n| `IndexError` | 列表索引越界 |\n| `FileNotFoundError` | 文件不存在 |\n\n## 自定义异常\n```python\nclass NegativeNumberError(Exception):\n    pass\n\ndef check_positive(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        raise NegativeNumberError('不允许负数')\n    return True\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写函数 `safe_divide(a, b)`，安全地执行除法：如果b=0返回错误信息，否则返回结果。\n编写函数 `parse_int(s)`，将字符串转为整数，失败时返回None。\n",
    "order": 12,
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "xp_reward": 15,
    "starter_code": "def safe_divide(a, b):\n    # 安全除法\n    pass\n\ndef parse_int(s):\n    # 解析整数\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "def safe_divide(a, b):\n    try:\n        return str(a / b)\n    except ZeroDivisionError:\n        return '除数不能为零'\n\ndef parse_int(s):\n    try:\n        return str(int(s))\n    except (ValueError, TypeError):\n        return 'None'",
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "input": "safe_divide(10, 2)",
        "expected_output": "5.0",
        "description": "safe_divide(10, 2) 应返回 5.0"
      },
      {
        "input": "safe_divide(10, 0)",
        "expected_output": "除数不能为零",
        "description": "safe_divide(10, 0) 应返回错误信息"
      },
      {
        "input": "safe_divide(0, 5)",
        "expected_output": "0.0",
        "description": "safe_divide(0, 5) 应返回 0.0（分子为零）"
      },
      {
        "input": "parse_int('42')",
        "expected_output": "42",
        "description": "parse_int('42') 应返回 42"
      },
      {
        "input": "parse_int('abc')",
        "expected_output": "None",
        "description": "parse_int('abc') 应返回 None"
      },
      {
        "input": "parse_int('')",
        "expected_output": "None",
        "description": "parse_int('') 应返回 None（空字符串）"
      }
    ],
    "hint": "使用 try/except 捕获 ZeroDivisionError 和 ValueError"
  },
  {
    "title": "文件操作",
    "slug": "python-13-file-io",
    "description": "学习文件的读写操作",
    "content": "# 文件操作\n\n## 打开和读取文件\n```python\n# 使用 with 语句（推荐，自动关闭文件）\nwith open('data.txt', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    content = f.read()          # 读取全部内容\n    # 或逐行读取\n    lines = f.readlines()       # 读取所有行\n\n# 逐行读取（大文件推荐）\nwith open('data.txt', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        print(line.strip())\n```\n\n## 写入文件\n```python\n# 'w' — 覆盖写入\n# 'a' — 追加写入\n# 'x' — 排他创建（文件已存在则报错）\n\nwith open('output.txt', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write('Hello, World!\\n')\n    f.writelines(['line 1\\n', 'line 2\\n'])\n```\n\n## 文件模式\n| 模式 | 含义 |\n|------|------|\n| `'r'` | 只读（默认） |\n| `'w'` | 写入（覆盖） |\n| `'a'` | 追加 |\n| `'x'` | 排他创建 |\n| `'rb'`/`'wb'` | 二进制模式 |\n| `'r+'` | 读写 |\n\n## os.path 常用操作\n```python\nimport os\nos.path.exists('file.txt')     # 文件是否存在\nos.path.dirname('/a/b.txt')    # '/a'\nos.path.basename('/a/b.txt')   # 'b.txt'\nos.path.splitext('a.txt')      # ('a', '.txt')\nos.path.join('dir', 'file')    # 'dir/file'（跨平台）\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写函数 `read_lines(filename)`，读取文件并返回行数。\n编写函数 `count_words_in_file(filename)`，统计文件中单词总数。\n",
    "order": 13,
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "xp_reward": 15,
    "starter_code": "def read_lines(filename):\n    # 返回文件行数\n    pass\n\ndef count_words_in_file(filename):\n    # 返回文件单词数\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "def read_lines(filename):\n    try:\n        with open(filename, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            return len(f.readlines())\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        return 0\n\ndef count_words_in_file(filename):\n    try:\n        with open(filename, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            return len(f.read().split())\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        return 0",
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "input": "read_lines('python-13-input.txt')",
        "expected_output": "3",
        "description": "read_lines 应返回文件行数"
      },
      {
        "input": "count_words_in_file('python-13-input.txt')",
        "expected_output": "9",
        "description": "count_words_in_file 应返回单词总数"
      },
      {
        "input": "read_lines('nonexistent.txt')",
        "expected_output": "0",
        "description": "read_lines 文件不存在时应返回 0"
      }
