    "title": "正则表达式",
    "slug": "python-21-regex",
    "description": "学习正则表达式的基本用法",
    "content": "# 栈与队列\n\n## 栈（Stack）\n栈是**后进先出（LIFO）**的数据结构，Python中可用列表模拟：\n\n```python\nstack = []\nstack.append(1)    # 入栈（push）\nstack.append(2)\nstack.append(3)\nstack.pop()        # 3（出栈，pop）\nstack.pop()        # 2\nlen(stack)         # 1（栈大小）\n\n# 查看栈顶（不弹出）\nstack[-1]          # 1\n```\n\n### 栈的应用\n- 函数调用栈\n- 撤销/重做（Undo/Redo）\n- 括号匹配验证\n- 表达式求值\n\n```python\n# 括号匹配\ndef is_balanced(s):\n    stack = []\n    pairs = {')': '(', ']': '[', '}': '{'}\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in '([{':\n            stack.append(ch)\n        elif ch in ')]}':\n            if not stack or stack.pop() != pairs[ch]:\n                return False\n    return len(stack) == 0\n```\n\n## 队列（Queue）\n队列是**先进先出（FIFO）**的数据结构：\n\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\nqueue = deque()\nqueue.append(1)       # 入队\nqueue.append(2)\nqueue.append(3)\nqueue.popleft()       # 1（出队!）\nqueue.popleft()       # 2\n\n# deque 两端都可操作\nqueue.appendleft(0)   # 左端入队\nqueue.pop()           # 右端出队\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写函数 `validate_brackets(s)`，验证括号是否正确匹配。\n",
    "order": 21,
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "xp_reward": 20,
    "starter_code": "def validate_brackets(s):\n    # 验证括号匹配\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "def validate_brackets(s):\n    stack = []\n    pairs = {')': '(', ']': '[', '}': '{'}\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in pairs.values():\n            stack.append(ch)\n        elif ch in pairs:\n            if not stack or stack.pop() != pairs[ch]:\n                return False\n    return len(stack) == 0",
    "test_cases": [
