  {
    "title": "装饰器",
    "slug": "python-22-decorators",
    "description": "学习装饰器的概念和用法",
    "content": "# 正则表达式\n\n正则表达式（Regex）是一种强大的模式匹配工具，用于搜索、匹配和替换文本。\n\n## re 模块基础\n```python\nimport re\n\n# re.search — 搜索第一个匹配\nre.search(r'\\d+', 'abc123def')     # Match对象\n\n# re.findall — 查找所有匹配\nre.findall(r'\\d+', 'a1b2c3')       # ['1', '2', '3']\n\n# re.sub — 替换\nre.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', 'a   b  c')    # 'a b c'\n\n# re.split — 分割\nre.split(r'[,\\s]+', 'a,b c  d')     # ['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']\n```\n\n## 常用模式\n```python\n\\d      # 数字 [0-9]\n\\w      # 字母数字下划线 [a-zA-Z0-9_]\n\\s      # 空白字符\n.        # 任意字符（除换行）\n^        # 行首\n$        # 行尾\n*        # 0次或多次\n+        # 1次或多次\n?        # 0次或1次\n{n}      # 精确n次\n{n,}     # 至少n次\n{n,m}    # n到m次\n[abc]    # 字符集\n[^abc]   # 否定字符集\n(a|b)    # 或\n```\n\n## 实用示例\n```python\n# 验证邮箱\nemail_pattern = r'^[\\w.-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.\\w+$'\nre.match(email_pattern, 'user@example.com')\n\n# 提取URL\nurl_pattern = r'https?://[\\w./-]+'\nurls = re.findall(url_pattern, text)\n\n# 提取中文字符\nchinese = re.findall(r'[\\u4e00-\\u9fff]+', 'Hello你好World世界')\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写函数 `is_valid_email(s)`，验证字符串是否为合法邮箱格式。\n编写函数 `extract_numbers(s)`，提取字符串中所有数字。\n",
    "order": 22,
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "xp_reward": 20,
    "starter_code": "import re\n\ndef is_valid_email(s):\n    # 验证邮箱格式\n    pass\n\ndef extract_numbers(s):\n    # 提取所有数字\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "import re\n\ndef is_valid_email(s):\n    pattern = r'^[\\w.-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.\\w+$'\n    return bool(re.match(pattern, s))\n\ndef extract_numbers(s):\n    return re.findall(r'\\d+', s)",
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "input": "is_valid_email('user@example.com')",
        "expected_output": "True",
        "description": "合法邮箱应返回 True"
      },
      {
        "input": "is_valid_email('invalid-email')",
        "expected_output": "False",
        "description": "非法邮箱应返回 False"
      },
      {
        "input": "is_valid_email('')",
        "expected_output": "False",
        "description": "空字符串应返回 False"
      },
      {
        "input": "extract_numbers('a1b2c3')",
        "expected_output": "['1', '2', '3']",
        "description": "extract_numbers 应提取所有数字"
      },
      {
        "input": "extract_numbers('no numbers here')",
        "expected_output": "[]",
        "description": "无数字时应返回空列表"
      }
    ],
    "hint": "使用 re.match(r'^[\\w.-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.\\w+$', s) 验证邮箱，re.findall(r'\\d+', s) 提取数字"
  },
  {
    "title": "生成器",
    "slug": "python-23-generators",
    "description": "学习生成器和 yield 关键字",
    "content": "# 生成器\n\n生成器使用 yield 产生值，惰性计算节省内存：\n\n```python\ndef countdown(n):\n    while n > 0:\n        yield n\n        n -= 1\n\nlist(countdown(5))  # [5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n```\n\n## 练习\n编写生成器函数 `fib_gen(n)`，生成前 n 个斐波那契数。\n\n\n## 带参数的装饰器\n```python\ndef repeat(times):\n    def decorator(func):\n        def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n            for _ in range(times):\n                result = func(*args, **kwargs)\n            return result\n        return wrapper\n    return decorator\n\n@repeat(3)\ndef greet(name):\n    print(f'Hello, {name}')\n\ngreet('Alice')  # 打印3次\n```\n\n## 常用内置装饰器\n```python\n# @staticmethod — 静态方法\nclass Math:\n    @staticmethod\n    def add(a, b):\n        return a + b\n\n# @classmethod — 类方法\nclass Person:\n    @classmethod\n    def from_birth_year(cls, name, year):\n        return cls(name, 2026 - year)\n\n# @property — 属性访问器\nclass Circle:\n    def __init__(self, radius):\n        self._radius = radius\n\n    @property\n    def area(self):\n        return 3.14159 * self._radius ** 2\n\n    @property\n    def radius(self):\n        return self._radius\n\n    @radius.setter\n    def radius(self, value):\n        if value < 0:\n            raise ValueError('半径不能为负')\n        self._radius = value\n```",
    "order": 23,
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "xp_reward": 20,
    "starter_code": "def fib_gen(n):\n    # 生成前n个斐波那契数\n    pass",
    "solution_code": "def fib_gen(n):\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        yield a\n        a, b = b, a + b",
    "test_cases": [
