    "title": "综合实战 - 学生管理",
    "slug": "python-24-student-manager",
    "description": "综合运用所学知识，实现一个简单的学生管理系统",
    "content": "# 综合实战 - 学生管理系统\n\n这是Python课程的毕业项目，综合运用前面学过的所有知识。\n\n## 项目需求\n实现一个学生成绩管理系统，支持：\n1. 添加学生（姓名和成绩）\n2. 查询学生成绩\n3. 计算平均分\n4. 获取最高/最低分\n5. 成绩等级评定\n\n## 数据结构设计\n```python\n# 用字典存储学生信息\nstudents = {\n    'Alice': {'scores': [85, 90, 78], 'id': 1},\n    'Bob': {'scores': [92, 88, 95], 'id': 2},\n}\n```\n\n## 实现要点\n- 使用**字典**存储学生数据\n- 使用**列表**存储成绩\n- 使用**异常处理**应对输入错误\n- 使用**列表推导式**处理数据\n- 使用**排序**展示排名\n\n## 练习\n编写 `StudentManager` 类，实现以下方法：\n\n```python\nclass StudentManager:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.students = {}\n\n    def add(self, name, score):\n        '''添加学生成绩'''\n\n    def get_average(self, name):\n        '''获取某学生平均分'''\n\n    def get_top(self, n):\n        '''获取前n名学生（按平均分排序）'''\n\n    def get_rank(self, name):\n        '''获取某学生排名（1-based）'''\n\n    def grade_summary(self):\n        '''返回各等级人数统计：{'优秀':x, '良好':y, '及格':z, '不及格':w}'\n```\n",
    "order": 24,
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "xp_reward": 25,
    "starter_code": "class StudentManager:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.students = {}\n\n    def add(self, name, score):\n        # 添加学生成绩\n        pass\n\n    def get_average(self, name):\n        # 返回学生平均分\n        pass\n\n    def get_top(self, n):\n        # 返回平均分最高的前n名学生 [{name, average}]\n        pass\n\n    def get_rank(self, name):\n        # 返回学生排名（1-based）\n        pass\n\n    def grade_summary(self):\n        # 返回各等级人数统计\n        pass",
    "solution_code": "class StudentManager:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.students = {}\n\n    def add(self, name, score):\n        if name not in self.students:\n            self.students[name] = []\n        self.students[name].append(score)\n\n    def get_average(self, name):\n        if name not in self.students or not self.students[name]:\n            return 0\n        return sum(self.students[name]) / len(self.students[name])\n\n    def get_top(self, n):\n        result = []\n        for name, scores in self.students.items():\n            avg = sum(scores) / len(scores) if scores else 0\n            result.append({'name': name, 'average': avg})\n        result.sort(key=lambda x: x['average'], reverse=True)\n        return result[:n]\n\n    def get_rank(self, name):\n        top = self.get_top(len(self.students))\n        for i, s in enumerate(top):\n            if s['name'] == name:\n                return i + 1\n        return -1\n\n    def grade_summary(self):\n        summary = {'优秀': 0, '良好': 0, '及格': 0, '不及格': 0}\n        for name, scores in self.students.items():\n            avg = sum(scores) / len(scores) if scores else 0\n            if avg >= 90:\n                summary['优秀'] += 1\n            elif avg >= 80:\n                summary['良好'] += 1\n            elif avg >= 60:\n                summary['及格'] += 1\n            else:\n                summary['不及格'] += 1\n        return summary",
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "input": "m=StudentManager(); m.add('Alice',85); m.add('Alice',92); m.get_average('Alice')",
        "expected_output": "88.5",
        "description": "平均分计算应正确"
      },
      {
        "input": "m=StudentManager(); m.add('Alice',85); m.add('Bob',92); [s['name'] for s in m.get_top(1)]",
        "expected_output": "['Bob']",
        "description": "get_top 应返回最高分学生"
      },
      {
        "input": "m=StudentManager(); [s['name'] for s in m.get_top(3)]",
        "expected_output": "[]",
        "description": "空管理器 get_top 应返回空列表"
      },
      {
        "input": "m=StudentManager(); m.add('Alice',95); m.add('Bob',85); m.add('Charlie',75); m.get_rank('Alice')",
        "expected_output": "1",
        "description": "最高分排名应为1"
      }
    ],
    "hint": "用字典存储学生-成绩列表，平均分用 sum()/len()，排名用 sorted()"
  }
